{"name":"-48-2-15","beats":[{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"9","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreenOn","value":"0,10","raw":"黑屏1"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"356","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"night","raw":"Night"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Room","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"In the Berlin safe house."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The moon is exceptionally bright tonight. An unexpected battle has finally come to an end. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"However, a new signal fire has just been lit."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Griffin","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}}],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_tele_connect","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"Griffin","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Commander, very nice to see you.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Griffin","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Likewise, Earl."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Griffin","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Griffin","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"It hasn't been all that long since we last talked.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"But by God am I glad to hear your voice again.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Griffin","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I'm very sorry, Earl. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I screwed it up. Even Squad Griffin was..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Griffin","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Griffin","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You need not apologize for anything.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"On the contrary, I feel incredibly fortunate that I have chosen you for this.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"If it had been anyone else, things would have become utterly hopeless by now... Report your situation.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Griffin","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"We have successfully recovered Morridow and done some work to render her harmless. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Information concerning Operation Cocoon has been sent to you. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Also...According to an unverifiable source, they are planning to launch the attack on Unity Day."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Griffin","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Griffin","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...I see. I'll keep that in mind.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Griffin","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Griffin","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I can only imagine the terrible ordeal you have gone through.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"In any case, thank you very much for your work, Commander.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The brave new world will remember your contribution.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Griffin","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Just doing my duty. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"...However, even though it has been a ride, it has to come to an end."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Griffin","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Griffin","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Do you believe this is where it ends?","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Is that what you want?","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Griffin","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"We do not have sufficient intelligence, and we are in unfamiliar territory. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"More importantly, our Dolls have suffered heavy casualties and ammo reserves are running low. We are in dire need of supplies... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"What I want is irrelevant. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Logically speaking, there is no way I can continue."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Griffin","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Griffin","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"It already brings me great comfort to learn that you are safe. On top of that, you have delivered such brilliant results.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"By all accounts, this is a resounding victory, and yet you seem dissatisfied.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Griffin","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...I should have done better."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Griffin","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Griffin","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"In this day and age, blood and tears are shed all too often.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Sometimes, people become desensitized because they have seen too much.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"This is more tragic even than the sad reality that we live in... But you're different, Commander. Your blood still runs hot.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Griffin","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Griffin","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Griffin","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You don't want this to be over, do you?","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"We may fail and suffer, but at the very least, we now have the initiative.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"If you give up today, and whoever replaces you ends up bringing even bleaker news... \"If it had been me, I would not have let things come to this.\"","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Are you sure you won't harbor such regret?","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Griffin","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The Commander lets out a long and heavy sigh."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...I require support. The more the better."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Morridow","expression":8,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,90"}}],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"background","value":"414","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":"Morridow","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_20Winter_Door_Open","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The sound of a door being pushed open breaks the silence in the room. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Morridow looks up with a smile, obviously expecting her visitor."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Morridow","expression":8,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,90"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Morridow","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I knew you would come and see me, Nimogen."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NytoIsomer","expression":12,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...I just want to help you take a good look at your own Virtual Cognition Image."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_20Winter_Door_Close","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"After closing the door lightly behind her, M4 slowly walks up to Morridow and towers over her as she has always done. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Looking up at M4 now, Morridow seems a lot more subdued than she usually is."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Morridow","expression":8,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,90"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Morridow","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Why did you save me, Nimogen? You don't even have the strength to do that again. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"If... I'm just saying... If they change their target next time, it'll be all over for you."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NytoIsomer","expression":12,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I don't want there to be a next time."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Morridow","expression":8,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,90"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Morridow","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Then why?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NytoIsomer","expression":12,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"M4 bends down and leans in close."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NytoIsomer","expression":12,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Didn't I tell you? I simply want to save you."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Morridow","expression":8,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,90"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Morridow","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...What a joke. If you want to save me, why don't you just release me?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NytoIsomer","expression":12,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I will."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Morridow","expression":9,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,90"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Morridow","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...What?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NytoIsomer","expression":12,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I said I will. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"But not now. Right now, I'd like to see the real you."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Morridow","expression":8,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,90"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Morridow","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Morridow blinks. Her mouth opens and closes in confusion. She eventually decides against saying anything."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"fadePointOn","raw":"黑点1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"356","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"fadePointOff","raw":"黑点2"},{"type":"night","raw":"Night"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The man in the comms channel falls silent for a moment."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Griffin","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Griffin","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"No problem, if support is all you need.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I can give you that. I will contact the base. A vehicle of sufficient size should be able to transport your forces to you.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Griffin","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...I didn't expect you'd go that far, to be honest."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Griffin","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Griffin","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"My opinion has not changed. Out of all the youngsters... ","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"You're the most trustworthy. Kryuger believes that, and so do I.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Griffin","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I will not betray your trust. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Though frankly speaking, your generous praise is a little disconcerting."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Griffin","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Griffin","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"True enough, you have much still to learn, and you are hardly perfect.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"But humans can never be perfect. Besides, you're still young and have plenty of time to learn through hardship.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"...However, with hardship comes suffering.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"You must learn to accept the many trials and tribulations you will encounter on this path you walk.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"For you, your most important lesson is to learn to accept losses.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Griffin","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...I can accept losses, and I respect everyone who has given their life, but that doesn't mean I can be glad for their sacrifices. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I will not pass up any chance of saving my friends, even if they are Dolls."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Griffin","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Griffin","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I sense a subtext, Commander.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Griffin","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"We've lost contact with Ange."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Griffin","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Griffin","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...It's true, she is currently MIA.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Griffin","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"May I take over the mission to search for her?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Griffin","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Griffin","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"This isn't a mission for you.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Too many personal feelings are involved, Commander.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Griffin","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...You have convinced me to stay in Berlin. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Since I have already made up my mind, I would like to earn my keep."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Griffin","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Griffin","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I obviously won't keep a ferocious tiger caged up.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"However, I have a more important task for you.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Griffin","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Griffin","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Griffin","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You're the only one who can put a stop to this impending fireworks show.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Griffin","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"But Ange..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Griffin","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Griffin","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You have inadvertently drawn Paradeus' attention to yourself while investigating the Iaso's Boxes.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Thanks to that, Ange's rescue mission will be much easier. I want you to trust me—I will never let a warrior wither away like this.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Griffin","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...I understand."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"background","value":"9","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"effect","value":"%%code=CJX_avg_hb%%","raw":"common_effect"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Leave it to me."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NytoIsomer","expression":12,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"background","value":"249","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Your \"Father\" keeps turning living humans into beings that are neither alive nor dead, all for the sake of finding semi-immunosomes that can resist Collapse radiation. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"...Unfortunately, it has all been in vain."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Morridow","expression":8,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,90"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Morridow","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...This is Paradeus' mission, Nimogen. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"We are blazing a trail to a new era... As our name suggests... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"We are leading ignorant humans to the real promised land."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NytoIsomer","expression":12,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Aren't you deluding yourself?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Morridow","expression":9,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,90"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Morridow","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Shut up."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Morridow's self-assuredness sudden vanishes completely. Her face darkens."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NytoIsomer","expression":12,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You reject yourself and your past. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"But they are forever a part of your base layer. Memory is irrefutable evidence. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"You are all failed specimens. You are but a mere shadow of her. Even if you put an end to it all yourself, there is no changing the truth."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Morridow","expression":9,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,90"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Morridow","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Her... You mean...Lunasia?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Morridow shakes her head vigorously, as if to shake off this terrible thought."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Morridow","expression":9,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,90"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Morridow","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Impossible... You're lying. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I'm a perfect being!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NytoIsomer","expression":12,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Really?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"M4 gives Morridow a pitying look."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NytoIsomer","expression":12,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...You are well aware of the truth."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Intimidated by M4, whose presence grows increasingly oppressive, Morridow backs away in fright and bumps into something. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"She turns around and finds herself staring at a mirror. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Reflected in the mirror is a corpse. The corpse writhing in the mud."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Morridow","expression":9,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,90"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Morridow","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"No... No... No!!!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"As Morridow lets out a horrified scream; the corpse's mouth is also agape."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Morridow","expression":9,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,90"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Morridow","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I'm not a failure... I'm not! I'm not!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Morridow","expression":9,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,90"}}],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"background","value":"9","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"closeMask","raw":"关闭蒙版"}],"speaker":"Morridow","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"This can't be... It can't be! If I'm a failure, what are you?!!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"356","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"fadePointOff","raw":"黑点2"},{"type":"night","raw":"Night"},{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_tele_disconnect","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"After ending the call with the Earl, the Commander drums their fingers on the desk thoughtfully."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...With the Earl's aid... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"We will stand a much better chance."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635Mod","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I hope Miss Ange will be okay..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635Mod","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"As long as we do our part, she'll be fine. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"This is Ange we're talking about. Have some faith in her."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635Mod","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RO635"